exports[`clamps both tab endpoints and reviews full answered questions only 1`] = `
" Asking User ·  ☒ Implementation  >  ☐ Second  >  Submit
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 Review your answers:

  ● You have not answered all questions

  Which implementation should we choose?
    → Alpha, Beta


 Ready to submit your answers?

 ❯ Submit answers
   Cancel

 Tab/←→ switch · Enter select · Esc cancel
"
`;

